# build/<preset>, so the newest record under build*/ and build/*/ is used; SUB0PERF_TOOLING_DIR overrides it. The gate prints
# one brief line (SUB0PERF_OUTPUT=brief; details are in the report path it names) and decides itself what to skip. A deferral
# (battery, battery saver, throttled machine) exits 0 and STANDS: never turn the gate's message into a failure, and never set
# SUB0MATH_PERF_ON_BATTERY here.
